<td class="text">Commitments and Contingencies<div style="margin-top:9pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Unconditional Purchase Obligations</span></div><div style="margin-top:6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Company has entered into certain off&#8211;balance sheet commitments that require the future purchase of goods or services (&#8220;unconditional purchase obligations&#8221;). The Company&#8217;s unconditional purchase obligations primarily consist of supplier arrangements, licensed intellectual property and content, and distribution rights. Future payments under unconditional purchase obligations with a remaining term in excess of one year as of June&#160;27, 2026, are as follows (in millions):</span></div><div style="margin-top:6pt;text-align:justify"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:85.303%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:12.497%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">2026 (remaining three months)</span></td><td style="padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">$</span></td><td style="padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">2,053&#160;</span></td><td style="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#efefef;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">2027</span></td><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#efefef;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">7,652&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#efefef;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">2028</span></td><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">6,406&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#efefef;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">2029</span></td><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#efefef;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">5,421&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#efefef;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">2030</span></td><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">5,481&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#efefef;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">Thereafter</span></td><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#efefef;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">615&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#efefef;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 19pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">Total</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;border-bottom:3pt double #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">$</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;border-bottom:3pt double #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:110%">27,628&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#ffffff;border-bottom:3pt double #000000;border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"></td></tr></table></div><div style="margin-top:18pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Contingencies</span></div><div style="margin-top:6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Helvetica',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Company is subject to various legal proceedings and claims that have arisen in the ordinary course of business and that have not been fully resolved. The outcome of litigation is inherently uncertain. In the opinion of management, there was not at least a reasonable possibility the Company may have incurred a material loss, or a material loss greater than a recorded accrual, concerning loss contingencies for asserted legal and other claims.</span></div><span></span>
